## Configuration variables

Values from the application's default profile, falling back to the module defaults. Names that
look like secrets, and any value that is an obfuscated password or a `%%placeholder%%`, are left
out on purpose.

| Variable | Value |
|---|---|
{% for x in vars -%}
{%- set n = x.n -%}{%- set v = x.v -%}
{%- set ln = n | lower -%}
{%- if not ("pass" in ln) and not ("secret" in ln) and not ("token" in ln) and not ("credential" in ln) and not ("key" in ln) -%}
{%- if not (v is string and (v.startsWith("#!") or v.startsWith("%%"))) -%}
| `${{ n }}` | ${{ ("`" + (v | string) + "`") if (v | string) != "" else "_(empty)_" }} |
{% endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor %}

